{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01AeN9QiqhaGGQ9dYehMSVTe","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_6/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-14\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **llama_docred_full_s1** (success): Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct + Grammar+Semantic 双层约束 (S1) 在 DocRED (96 relations) 上的效果。与 Qwen3-8B DocRED full_s1 (DR 10.19%) 对比，验证约束解码在不同模型+复杂 schema 上的泛化性。\\\\n  [llama_docred_full_s1_analysis](/api/workspace-files/projects/schema_semantic_constrained_ie/artifacts/llama_docred_full_s1/report/llama_docred_full_s1_analysis.md)\\\\n- **llama_docred_unconstrained** (success): Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct 在 DocRED unconstrained baseline。与 Qwen3-8B DocRED unconstrained 对比 violation 分布。验证不同模型在复杂 schema (96 relations) 上的 violation 模式差异。\\\\n- **phase2_docred_grammar_only** (success): Grammar-only constrained decoding 在 DocRED (96 relation types) 上能否消除 RV violations (28.9%) 和 ET violations (7.5%)？与 SciERC grammar_only (RV 1.4%→0%, ET 0.4%→0%) 对比，验证 grammar 层在复杂 schema 上的泛化性。\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 19 / 负向 0 / 失败 0 / 共 20\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nwestd-16980: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- mvp_phase0_docred_schema_r2: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1036, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01UzhmW6M29FkRXtpuYNW2DV","session_id":"b35164d6-59ff-4dc9-a0a2-e7bd8feeacab","uuid":"782484a5-c9d6-49aa-9fd8-05444d031a76","timestamp":"2026-05-14T21:46:14.931Z"}
